2. `assets/.pi/extensions/subagent/index.ts` (lines 220–245) — `mapWithConcurrencyLimit` helper for parallel tasks.
3. `assets/.pi/extensions/subagent/index.ts` (lines 594–815) — Tool registration, mode dispatch (single / parallel / chain).
4. `assets/.pi/extensions/subagent/agents.ts` (lines 1–140) — Agent markdown discovery (no spawn / timeout logic).
