  tasks: Type.Optional(Type.Array(TaskItem, { description: "..." })),
  chain: Type.Optional(Type.Array(ChainItem, { description: "..." })),
  agentScope: Type.Optional(AgentScopeSchema),
  cwd: Type.Optional(Type.String({ description: "..." })),
  model: Type.Optional(Type.String({ description: "..." })),
  resume: Type.Optional(Type.String({ description: "Resume a suspended subagent by suspensionId; restarts the 600s idle window and continues until process exit" })),
  kill: Type.Optional(Type.String({ description: "Kill a suspended subagent by suspensionId (SIGCONT then SIGKILL on the process group); returns the partial transcript" })),
  inspect: Type.Optional(ArbitrateParams),
});
```

**18. 改 `description` 字段**（主 agent 唯一信息源，必须明确说明）：
```
"Delegate tasks to specialized subagents with isolated context.
Modes: single (agent + task), parallel (tasks array), chain (sequential with {previous} placeholder).
Arbitration: if a subagent call returns status='idle_suspended', the child pi process is frozen (SIGSTOP on the whole process group). Use exactly one of { resume, kill, inspect } with the returned suspensionId to continue: resume=thaw and wait; kill=thaw then SIGKILL; inspect=peek at recent events without changing state. Resume and kill are mutually exclusive with single/parallel/chain. Inspect is read-only and also mutually exclusive with single/parallel/chain. ..."
```
